          "eyebrow": "Planned well ahead",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "A villa",
            "accent": "worth waiting for."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "Anh knew exactly what she wanted. She booked almost four months ahead and chose one of my favourite villas in Conca dei Marini. I had photographed there several times before and already loved the place. She and her boyfriend had reserved this beautiful villa with its extraordinary view.",
            "We met on 10 April 2026. April and October are my favourite months on the coast. You can see its beauty clearly, and in the morning there are still so few people that nothing gets in the way of enjoying it."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
