        {
          "eyebrow": "Coffee and cloud cover",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "The softest",
            "accent": "April light."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "When I arrived, they had only just had their first coffee. The morning was overcast, but in that particular Amalfi way. It was nothing like the grey skies I know from Eastern Europe: here it felt as though we were inside an enormous softbox.",
            "The sun stayed somewhere in the distance, and no direct rays reached our photographs. Everything else was wonderful. The soft light and the view from the villa were almost unreal."
          ]
        }
